-  <p class="muted">Short guide for the Standard Bank pilot.</p>
-  <section><h2>Starting the cashbook</h2><p>Double-click <strong>START CASHBOOK.bat</strong>. Keep the black Cashbook window open while you work. Your browser will open the local cashbook automatically.</p></section>
